            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A hybrid transmission (16) includes an electric transmission portion (16A) and a gear transmission portion (16B). The electric transmission portion (16A) includes a first motor generator (17) and a second motor generator (18). The second motor generator (18) is on a side of the first motor generator (17) on which side the gear transmission portion (16B) is disposed. An output transmission mechanism (130) configured to transmit the output from the second motor generator (18) to the gear transmission portion (16B) is on the side of the second motor generator (18) on which side the gear transmission portion (16B) is disposed.</p>
            </abstract>
